	{"id":"crew_02", "title":"Whose Good Idea Was It?", "body":"The new layout is helping. Two crew members now remember inventing it, and the notebook's owner is suddenly very interested in cleaning a tray. You have a queue forming and a small problem that could become a large silence.", "tags":["trading","staff","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":3, "once":true, "requires_staff":true, "requires_flag":"crew_trial", "choices":[
		{"label":"Credit the notebook's owner", "detail":"Free. Be specific, then thank everyone who tested it.", "result":"The idea keeps its author, and the team keeps its contribution.", "effects":{"morale":3,"loyalty":5,"clear_flag":"crew_trial","flag":"crew_legacy"}},
		{"label":"Make it a shared workshop", "detail":"$35 for a crew meal. Turn the tension into planning.", "result":"Everyone adds a suggestion. The notebook gains a second page.", "effects":{"cash":-35,"morale":6,"clear_flag":"crew_trial","flag":"crew_legacy"}},
		{"label":"Reset to the old layout", "detail":"Free. Crew morale -3; close the proposal.", "result":"The arrows disappear. So does some of the appetite for suggesting things.", "effects":{"morale":-3,"clear_flag":"crew_trial","flag":"crew_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"crew_03", "title":"A Book with Many Hands", "body":"The improvement notebook is now full of handwriting. Someone has added a closing checklist. Someone else has drawn a donut wearing safety boots. The last page asks whether new starters could be given a copy.", "tags":["trading","staff","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":4, "once":true, "requires_staff":true, "requires_flag":"crew_legacy", "choices":[
		{"label":"Print the crew's handbook", "detail":"$60. Gain 8 crew loyalty and 4 crew morale.", "result":"Every contributor gets their name inside. The safety-boots donut stays.", "effects":{"cash":-60,"loyalty":8,"morale":4,"clear_flag":"crew_legacy","flag":"crew_closed"}},
		{"label":"Keep a shared counter copy", "detail":"Free. Make good ideas part of everyday work.", "result":"The notebook takes its place beside the till, open to everyone.", "effects":{"loyalty":4,"quality":0.08,"clear_flag":"crew_legacy","flag":"crew_closed"}},
		{"label":"Celebrate over closing tea", "detail":"Free. Take 6% capacity for an unhurried thank-you.", "result":"Nobody calls it a handbook. Everyone knows they helped build the place.", "effects":{"delay":0.06,"morale":7,"clear_flag":"crew_legacy","flag":"crew_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"rival_01", "title":"Orbit Rings, Next Pitch Over", "body":"Mara from Orbit Rings parks beside you. Her sign is brighter. Her kettle is older. She offers a handshake and says there is room for two good donut stands, provided neither of you blocks the fire lane.", "tags":["trading","neighbours","story"], "weight":1.4, "min_day":2, "once":true, "choices":[
		{"label":"Swap a tasting bag", "detail":"Use 6 stock. Start with friendly curiosity.", "result":"Her cinnamon is excellent. You both pretend not to take mental notes.", "effects":{"stock":-6,"relationship":3,"flag":"rival_friend"}},
		{"label":"Share a friendly hello", "detail":"Free. Set clear pitch boundaries and wish her well.", "result":"The handshake is firm. The fire lane remains impressively clear.", "effects":{"rep":1,"flag":"rival_friend"}},
		{"label":"Focus on your own queue", "detail":"Free. Stay polite and keep the relationship distant.", "result":"You nod across the lane. A nod is enough for today.", "effects":{"demand":0.02,"flag":"rival_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"rival_02", "title":"Mara's Missing Delivery", "body":"Orbit Rings has a queue and no fresh bags. Mara's delivery went to a similarly named fair two towns away. She asks whether you could spare supplies until closing. It is an awkward favour between people selling the same thing.", "tags":["trading","neighbours","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":3, "once":true, "requires_flag":"rival_friend", "choices":[
		{"label":"Lend 25 servings of stock", "detail":"Use 25 stock. Keep a neighbour trading.", "result":"Mara writes the amount down carefully. She intends to remember this.", "effects":{"stock":-25,"rep":2,"clear_flag":"rival_friend","flag":"rival_return"}},
		{"label":"Help redirect the delivery", "detail":"Free. Lose 8% capacity making calls and giving directions.", "result":"The driver finally finds the correct enormous inflatable duck.", "effects":{"delay":0.08,"relationship":2,"clear_flag":"rival_friend","flag":"rival_return"}},
		{"label":"Explain you cannot spare it", "detail":"Free. Protect your own small operation honestly.", "result":"Mara understands. Some days a handshake is all you can afford.", "effects":{"clear_flag":"rival_friend","flag":"rival_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"rival_03", "title":"The Favour Comes Around", "body":"Mara arrives with a box of supplies and news of a spare overflow pitch. She remembers your help. The organiser needs somebody reliable, and she has already said your name. Her kettle whistles from across the lane.", "tags":["trading","neighbours","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":4, "once":true, "requires_flag":"rival_return", "choices":[
		{"label":"Take the overflow crowd", "detail":"Free. Demand +18%; stock +25.", "result":"Two friendly stands feed a very hungry fair.", "effects":{"stock":25,"demand":0.18,"clear_flag":"rival_return","flag":"rival_closed"}},
		{"label":"Share a joint queue sign", "detail":"$30. Gain 4 reputation and stronger local ties.", "result":"The sign sends customers to whichever queue is shorter. Nobody loses their lunch break.", "effects":{"cash":-30,"rep":4,"relationship":5,"clear_flag":"rival_return","flag":"rival_closed"}},
		{"label":"Accept supplies and tea", "detail":"Free. Stock +25 and a calmer afternoon.", "result":"You compare notes on rain, roads, and the economics of paper napkins.", "effects":{"stock":25,"morale":5,"clear_flag":"rival_return","flag":"rival_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"mascot_01", "title":"An Emergency Turnip", "body":"The fair's turnip mascot has no performer. A volunteer holds out a purple-and-cream costume and looks at your stand with dangerous hope. Apparently the turnip must open the vegetable parade in twenty minutes.", "tags":["trading","community","story"], "weight":1.2, "min_day":1, "once":true, "choices":[
		{"label":"Take a brief turn as turnip", "detail":"Free. Lose 12% capacity; gain 3 local goodwill.", "result":"You wave with botanical dignity. Children cheer. Somebody takes a photograph.", "effects":{"delay":0.12,"relationship":3,"flag":"mascot_photo"}},
		{"label":"Sponsor a volunteer break", "detail":"$45. Help the committee find a rested performer.", "result":"The parade gets its turnip, and the volunteer gets a proper lunch.", "effects":{"cash":-45,"rep":2,"flag":"mascot_photo"}},
		{"label":"Cheer from the counter", "detail":"Free. Keep trading and support from the sidelines.", "result":"The turnip eventually finds a human. You applaud the transformation.", "effects":{"morale":2,"flag":"mascot_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"mascot_02", "title":"The Turnip in the Paper", "body":"The community paper has printed a photograph of the vegetable parade. Your stand is in the background, looking rather lovely. The caption names your business correctly, which everyone agrees is a rare and valuable achievement.", "tags":["trading","community","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":2, "once":true, "requires_flag":"mascot_photo", "choices":[
		{"label":"Put the clipping on display", "detail":"Free. Demand +6% today.", "result":"Customers lean in to inspect the turnip. Then they notice the donuts.", "effects":{"demand":0.06,"clear_flag":"mascot_photo","flag":"mascot_return"}},
		{"label":"Thank the parade volunteers", "detail":"Use 10 stock. Let the people behind it share the moment.", "result":"A tired committee eats warm donuts under a very purple photograph.", "effects":{"stock":-10,"relationship":4,"clear_flag":"mascot_photo","flag":"mascot_return"}},
		{"label":"Save it for your scrapbook", "detail":"Free. Keep a private memory and finish the story.", "result":"The scrapbook gains an excellent explanation for a very strange morning.", "effects":{"morale":3,"clear_flag":"mascot_photo","flag":"mascot_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"mascot_03", "title":"The Vegetable Delegation", "body":"A beetroot, a carrot, and the famous turnip arrive at the stand. They are off duty, deeply warm, and delighted that you supported the parade. Their handler offers a quick photograph before the costumes return to storage.", "tags":["trading","community","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":3, "once":true, "requires_flag":"mascot_return", "choices":[
		{"label":"Take the group photograph", "detail":"Free. Gain 3 fame; demand +5% today.", "result":"Your business is now officially recommended by three vegetables.", "effects":{"fame":3,"demand":0.05,"clear_flag":"mascot_return","flag":"mascot_closed"}},
		{"label":"Offer a quiet cool-down", "detail":"Use 12 stock. Gain 6 local goodwill.", "result":"Behind the costumes are three grateful people with astonishing hair.", "effects":{"stock":-12,"relationship":6,"clear_flag":"mascot_return","flag":"mascot_closed"}},
		{"label":"Give the crew the spotlight", "detail":"Free. Gain 6 crew morale and 2 crew loyalty.", "result":"The carrot borrows an apron. The crew's photograph is much better than a business card.", "effects":{"morale":6,"loyalty":2,"clear_flag":"mascot_return","flag":"mascot_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"radio_01", "title":"Tea after the Broadcast", "body":"A volunteer radio host finishes the evening fair report beside your pitch. Her tea is cold and her voice is tired. She asks what brought you onto the circuit, then remembers that interviews are technically over for the day.", "tags":["trading","music","story"], "weight":1.2, "min_day":2, "once":true, "choices":[
		{"label":"Share the honest beginning", "detail":"Free. Take 5% capacity for a good conversation.", "result":"She likes the part about the used van more than your polished business pitch.", "effects":{"delay":0.05,"flag":"radio_dedication"}},
		{"label":"Send a warm closing bag", "detail":"Use 5 stock. Make a tired volunteer's evening.", "result":"She promises no publicity. You say the bag is still hers.", "effects":{"stock":-5,"rep":1,"flag":"radio_dedication"}},
		{"label":"Wish her a restful night", "detail":"Free. Keep the evening simple.", "result":"Some conversations end with a wave. It is a friendly one.", "effects":{"morale":1,"flag":"radio_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"radio_02", "title":"A Dedication from the Road", "body":"The radio host mentions your little business during a song dedication. She calls it a place that made a long evening feel shorter. Two customers arrive saying they heard the story while driving to the fair.", "tags":["trading","music","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":3, "once":true, "requires_flag":"radio_dedication", "choices":[
		{"label":"Welcome the radio listeners", "detail":"Free. Demand +12% today.", "result":"Several people hum the dedication song while waiting.", "effects":{"demand":0.12,"fame":1,"clear_flag":"radio_dedication","flag":"radio_finale"}},
		{"label":"Record a thank-you message", "detail":"Free. Gain 2 fame and 2 local goodwill.", "result":"Your first take includes a fryer beep. She keeps it.", "effects":{"fame":2,"relationship":2,"clear_flag":"radio_dedication","flag":"radio_finale"}},
		{"label":"Enjoy it quietly", "detail":"Free. Take the reputation boost and leave it there.", "result":"You turn the radio up just enough to hear it over the kettle.", "effects":{"rep":2,"clear_flag":"radio_dedication","flag":"radio_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"radio_03", "title":"The Sound of a Small Business", "body":"The host asks for a short recorded piece about life on the circuit. She wants the queue, the fryer, and the moment the lights come on. For once, someone considers the sound of your working day worth listening to.", "tags":["trading","music","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":4, "once":true, "requires_flag":"radio_finale", "choices":[
		{"label":"Tell the crew's story", "detail":"Free. Gain 4 fame and 4 crew morale.", "result":"Everyone gets a line. Someone's laugh becomes the best part.", "effects":{"fame":4,"morale":4,"clear_flag":"radio_finale","flag":"radio_closed"}},
		{"label":"Record a careful soundscape", "detail":"$40 for a quiet hour of preparation. Gain 5 fame.", "result":"A paper bag rustles, the fair cheers, and your small world goes on air.", "effects":{"cash":-40,"fame":5,"rep":2,"clear_flag":"radio_finale","flag":"radio_closed"}},
		{"label":"Recommend another trader", "detail":"Free. Share the opportunity; gain 5 local goodwill.", "result":"The puppet-show owner has enough stories for an entire series.", "effects":{"relationship":5,"rep":2,"clear_flag":"radio_finale","flag":"radio_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"awning_01", "title":"Rain at the Stitching Tent", "body":"A sudden shower finds every seam in the neighbouring craft tent. A quilt seller is trying to cover thirty handmade cushions with one small umbrella. Your awning has a little room if you move a supply box.", "tags":["trading","weather","story"], "weight":1.3, "min_day":1, "once":true, "choices":[
		{"label":"Make room under the awning", "detail":"Free. Lose 8% capacity; gain 3 local goodwill.", "result":"The cushions stay dry. Your stand briefly looks wonderfully upholstered.", "effects":{"delay":0.08,"relationship":3,"flag":"awning_offer"}},
		{"label":"Buy a shared rain sheet", "detail":"$55. Shelter two stalls without losing counter space.", "result":"The sheet is bright blue. Everyone can find your pitch now.", "effects":{"cash":-55,"rep":2,"flag":"awning_offer"}},
		{"label":"Help find the organiser", "detail":"Free. Get the seller practical help and keep trading.", "result":"A spare shelter arrives from the stores tent.", "effects":{"relationship":1,"flag":"awning_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"awning_02", "title":"A Stitched Thank-You", "body":"The quilt seller returns with a little fabric pennant bearing your company colours. She offers to make a whole string at materials cost. Apparently every good trading pitch deserves something that moves nicely in the breeze.", "tags":["trading","community","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":2, "once":true, "requires_flag":"awning_offer", "choices":[
		{"label":"Order the full bunting", "detail":"$75. Demand +10% today; gain 2 local goodwill.", "result":"The stand looks like it belongs in the fair, rather than merely attending.", "effects":{"cash":-75,"demand":0.1,"relationship":2,"clear_flag":"awning_offer","flag":"awning_return"}},
		{"label":"Hang the single pennant", "detail":"Free. A small gesture still means a great deal.", "result":"It catches the breeze above the menu. You point out who made it.", "effects":{"rep":2,"clear_flag":"awning_offer","flag":"awning_return"}},
		{"label":"Trade thanks and a wave", "detail":"Free. Close the story with a friendly neighbour.", "result":"The pennant goes safely in the van for another day.", "effects":{"morale":3,"clear_flag":"awning_offer","flag":"awning_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"awning_03", "title":"A Circle of Dry Places", "body":"Another shower rolls through. This time, nearby traders pull their shelters together before anyone asks. The quilt seller calls it the dry-places club. Your little pennant marks one corner of an unexpectedly cheerful covered lane.", "tags":["trading","weather","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":3, "once":true, "requires_flag":"awning_return", "choices":[
		{"label":"Keep the covered lane fed", "detail":"Use 15 stock. Gain 5 reputation and 5 local goodwill.", "result":"Wet visitors become warm customers, and the lane stays cheerful.", "effects":{"stock":-15,"rep":5,"relationship":5,"clear_flag":"awning_return","flag":"awning_closed"}},
		{"label":"Take turns directing people", "detail":"Free. Demand +12% and a stronger local relationship.", "result":"Nobody owns the whole queue. Everyone helps it find somewhere dry.", "effects":{"demand":0.12,"relationship":3,"clear_flag":"awning_return","flag":"awning_closed"}},
		{"label":"Offer the crew a dry break", "detail":"Free. Lose 6% capacity; gain 8 crew morale.", "result":"For once, the break-time tea comes without rainwater.", "effects":{"delay":0.06,"morale":8,"clear_flag":"awning_return","flag":"awning_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"goose_01", "title":"One Small Lost Goose", "body":"A plush goose sits on an empty bench, wearing a knitted orange scarf. Nobody nearby claims it. Its stitched expression suggests it has been having a difficult afternoon. You could help it find its person.", "tags":["trading","family","story"], "weight":1.3, "min_day":1, "once":true, "choices":[
		{"label":"Put up a found-goose note", "detail":"Free. Gain local goodwill and begin the search.", "result":"The goose waits beside the till with an excellent view of the fair.", "effects":{"relationship":2,"flag":"goose_owner"}},
		{"label":"Ask the fair's lost property", "detail":"Free. Spend 5% capacity getting the search organised.", "result":"The steward writes: One goose, scarf, emotionally important.", "effects":{"delay":0.05,"rep":1,"flag":"goose_owner"}},
		{"label":"Leave it with the steward", "detail":"Free. The proper desk can handle the reunion.", "result":"The goose moves to a safe place beside two umbrellas and a violin case.", "effects":{"rep":1,"flag":"goose_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"goose_02", "title":"Goose Reunion, Three O'Clock", "body":"A child in an orange scarf rushes up with a relieved parent. The goose is named Captain Honk and apparently manages all family travel arrangements. The reunion is brief, enormous, and slightly sticky.", "tags":["trading","family","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":2, "once":true, "requires_flag":"goose_owner", "choices":[
		{"label":"Send them off with a treat", "detail":"Use 4 stock. Gain 3 reputation.", "result":"Captain Honk is given strict instructions to share.", "effects":{"stock":-4,"rep":3,"clear_flag":"goose_owner","flag":"goose_letter"}},
		{"label":"Salute Captain Honk", "detail":"Free. Give the reunion a fitting send-off.", "result":"The child returns a very serious salute. The parent nearly cries laughing.", "effects":{"rep":2,"morale":3,"clear_flag":"goose_owner","flag":"goose_letter"}},
		{"label":"Accept a quiet thank-you", "detail":"Free. A good deed can end right here.", "result":"The family heads back toward the rides, complete again.", "effects":{"relationship":3,"clear_flag":"goose_owner","flag":"goose_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"goose_03", "title":"Post from Captain Honk", "body":"A handmade card arrives through the fair office. It shows your stand, the family, and a goose three times larger than the van. Inside is a declaration that your business is now a Safe Harbour for Geese.", "tags":["trading","family","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":3, "once":true, "requires_flag":"goose_letter", "choices":[
		{"label":"Display the official charter", "detail":"Free. Gain 3 reputation and 2 fame.", "result":"Customers inspect the drawing with the respect a goose charter deserves.", "effects":{"rep":3,"fame":2,"clear_flag":"goose_letter","flag":"goose_closed"}},
		{"label":"Send a thank-you postcard", "detail":"$5. Give the story another happy page.", "result":"You address it to Captain Honk, care of the family.", "effects":{"cash":-5,"relationship":4,"morale":3,"clear_flag":"goose_letter","flag":"goose_closed"}},
		{"label":"Keep it in the van", "detail":"Free. Gain 6 crew morale and a very good reminder.", "result":"On the hard days, the giant goose will be watching over you.", "effects":{"morale":6,"clear_flag":"goose_letter","flag":"goose_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"orchard_01", "title":"Apples with Character", "body":"An orchard grower has a crate of sound, oddly shaped apples that the display judges passed over. She says they taste exactly as good as handsome apples. One looks remarkably like a small clenched fist.", "tags":["trading","agricultural","story"], "weight":1.3, "min_day":2, "once":true, "choices":[
		{"label":"Buy the good odd apples", "detail":"$40. Quality +0.12 today; start a local connection.", "result":"The fist-shaped apple produces an entirely peaceful flavour.", "effects":{"cash":-40,"quality":0.12,"flag":"orchard_partner"}},
		{"label":"Arrange a small tasting swap", "detail":"Use 8 stock. Share your respective specialities.", "result":"She brings apple slices. You bring warm bags. Nobody misses the judging table.", "effects":{"stock":-8,"relationship":2,"flag":"orchard_partner"}},
		{"label":"Point her toward the cooks", "detail":"Free. Find the crate a useful home.", "result":"The community kitchen is delighted by apples with personality.", "effects":{"relationship":2,"flag":"orchard_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"orchard_02", "title":"The Grower's Chalkboard", "body":"The grower would like you to tell customers where the fruit came from. She offers a small crate for a fair price and a photograph of the orchard in blossom. The photograph is much better than her handwriting.", "tags":["trading","agricultural","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":3, "once":true, "requires_flag":"orchard_partner", "choices":[
		{"label":"Make a proper orchard sign", "detail":"$45. Quality +0.1; gain 3 local goodwill.", "result":"The growers get their name on the board, and customers ask about the trees.", "effects":{"cash":-45,"quality":0.1,"relationship":3,"clear_flag":"orchard_partner","flag":"orchard_harvest"}},
		{"label":"Tell customers in person", "detail":"Free. Build the connection one conversation at a time.", "result":"The orchard becomes a place people can picture, not just an ingredient.", "effects":{"rep":2,"clear_flag":"orchard_partner","flag":"orchard_harvest"}},
		{"label":"Keep the purchase occasional", "detail":"Free. End the arrangement warmly.", "result":"You thank her and keep the blossom photograph with the recipe notes.", "effects":{"morale":2,"clear_flag":"orchard_partner","flag":"orchard_closed"}}
	]},
	{"id":"orchard_03", "title":"A Harvest Thank-You", "body":"The grower brings news: people from the fair visited her farm shop after seeing your sign or hearing your story. She has brought a harvest crate and an invitation to keep helping small local businesses find one another.", "tags":["trading","agricultural","story"], "weight":5.0, "min_day":4, "once":true, "requires_flag":"orchard_harvest", "choices":[
		{"label":"Celebrate the growers", "detail":"Use 10 stock. Gain 5 reputation and 5 local goodwill.", "result":"A little board now lists several people who helped make the day's food.", "effects":{"stock":-10,"rep":5,"relationship":5,"clear_flag":"orchard_harvest","flag":"orchard_closed"}},
		{"label":"Enjoy the shared success", "detail":"Free. Quality +0.15 and demand +6% today.", "result":"The harvest crate becomes a very good day's special.", "effects":{"quality":0.15,"demand":0.06,"clear_flag":"orchard_harvest","flag":"orchard_closed"}},
		{"label":"Introduce another stall", "detail":"Free. Gain 7 local goodwill.", "result":"The pie seller and the orchard grower immediately begin discussing sizes of crates.", "effects":{"relationship":7,"clear_flag":"orchard_harvest","flag":"orchard_closed"}}
	]},
	# Everyday business, weather, equipment, crew, and pleasant surprises.
	{"id":"delivery_damp", "title":"The Box beneath the Drip", "body":"A delivery box has arrived with a wet corner. Most of it is fine, but some packaging has soaked through. The driver offers a small refund or a replacement run that will take part of the morning.", "tags":["trading","supplies"], "weight":1.1, "min_day":1, "once":false, "choices":[
		{"label":"Buy clean replacement bags", "detail":"$35. Keep the full day running smoothly.", "result":"Fresh packaging arrives from the fair's stores tent.", "effects":{"cash":-35,"quality":0.04}},
		{"label":"Wait for the replacement", "detail":"Free. Lose 10% of today's capacity.", "result":"The driver returns as promised, carrying a conspicuously dry box.", "effects":{"delay":0.1}},
		{"label":"Take the refund and sort", "detail":"Receive $20. Lose 8 stock while discarding damaged supplies.", "result":"Only sound, dry supplies reach the counter. The ruined items go in the bin.", "effects":{"cash":20,"stock":-8}}
	]},
	{"id":"surprise_bus", "title":"The Unscheduled Coach", "body":"A coach pulls in carrying a walking club whose planned cafe is closed. They have forty minutes, matching hats, and an impressive appetite. Their leader asks whether your little stand can take a sudden crowd.", "tags":["trading","opportunity"], "weight":1.1, "min_day":2, "once":false, "choices":[
		{"label":"Welcome the whole coach", "detail":"Demand +25%. 25% risk: reputation -2 and crew morale -2.", "result":"The matching hats form a remarkably orderly line.", "effects":{"demand":0.25}, "risk":{"chance":0.25,"effects":{"rep":-2,"morale":-2},"summary":"The last walkers waited too long; the rushed service disappointed them."}},
		{"label":"Offer a realistic time slot", "detail":"Free. Demand +12%; keep expectations clear.", "result":"Half the club visits the craft tents first. Everyone knows when to return.", "effects":{"demand":0.12,"rep":1}},
		{"label":"Serve only your normal queue", "detail":"Free. Keep the workload manageable.", "result":"You explain the wait honestly. The leader appreciates a clear answer.", "effects":{"morale":2}}
	]},
	{"id":"queue_murmur", "title":"The Queue Begins to Murmur", "body":"A group has been waiting longer than expected. One customer asks whether anyone is actually counting the orders. You are, but your system currently involves three folded receipts and a hopeful memory.", "tags":["trading","customers"], "weight":1.2, "min_day":1, "once":false, "choices":[
		{"label":"Reset and number the orders", "detail":"Free. Lose 8% capacity; gain 1 reputation.", "result":"Clear numbers do what hopeful memory could not.", "effects":{"delay":0.08,"rep":1}},
		{"label":"Offer a small apology batch", "detail":"Use 10 stock. Keep the queue feeling cared for.", "result":"The apology helps, and you number the orders while people eat.", "effects":{"stock":-10,"rep":2}},
		{"label":"Promise a very fast catch-up", "detail":"Free. Demand +5%; 35% risk: reputation -3 and quality -0.1.", "result":"You pick up the pace and try to keep every promise.", "effects":{"demand":0.05}, "risk":{"chance":0.35,"effects":{"rep":-3,"quality":-0.1},"summary":"The promised speed was unrealistic, and the queue noticed."}}
	]},
	{"id":"portion_question", "title":"The Bag Looks Smaller", "body":"A regular says today's bag looks smaller than last time. The portions are correct, but the new paper bags are wider. Three people nearby are listening with the solemn interest reserved for questions of snack fairness.", "tags":["trading","customers"], "weight":1.0, "min_day":1, "once":false, "choices":[
		{"label":"Explain and show the portion", "detail":"Free. A calm answer protects trust.", "result":"You count out a portion clearly. The regular nods and relaxes.", "effects":{"rep":1}},
		{"label":"Add a goodwill extra", "detail":"Use 5 stock. Gain 3 reputation.", "result":"The extra is appreciated. You also make the portion size clearer on the board.", "effects":{"stock":-5,"rep":3}},
		{"label":"Update the menu wording", "detail":"Free. Lose 4% capacity to make portions easy to understand.", "result":"The board now answers the question before it becomes a complaint.", "effects":{"delay":0.04,"quality":0.05}}
	]},
	{"id":"price_comparison", "title":"Cheaper across the Field", "body":"A visitor points out that another stall is cheaper. Their friend points out that the other stall also sells inflatable swords. The comparison is not entirely useful, but this is a chance to explain what makes your bags worth buying.", "tags":["trading","customers"], "weight":1.0, "min_day":1, "once":false, "choices":[
		{"label":"Explain the fresh batches", "detail":"Free. Gain 1 reputation through a clear, friendly answer.", "result":"You talk about the food, and let customers choose for themselves.", "effects":{"rep":1}},
		{"label":"Offer tiny tasting pieces", "detail":"Use 8 stock. Demand +8% today.", "result":"A warm sample makes the case more clearly than a long speech.", "effects":{"stock":-8,"demand":0.08}},
		{"label":"Keep the conversation light", "detail":"Free. Avoid an argument and return to the queue.", "result":"You admit the swords are excellent. Everyone laughs.", "effects":{"morale":2}}
	]},
	{"id":"rain_menu", "title":"Today's Special: Washed Ink", "body":"A brief shower turns the bottom half of your handwritten menu into a mysterious brown cloud. One visitor asks whether the special is called cinnamon or submarine. Your recipe deserves a more legible introduction.", "tags":["trading","weather"], "weight":1.1, "min_day":1, "once":false, "choices":[
		{"label":"Buy a waterproof sleeve", "detail":"$20. Keep the menu clear and demand steady.", "result":"The sleeve fits perfectly. Submarine donuts are quietly discontinued.", "effects":{"cash":-20,"quality":0.03}},
		{"label":"Rewrite it under the awning", "detail":"Free. Lose 5% capacity to make a fresh sign.", "result":"The new lettering is larger and much easier to read.", "effects":{"delay":0.05}},
